Z||000002||Gokart||06-29-2000||09:13 PM||||There American Racing rims that looked like hell when I bought the car. I stripped them down, painted them black then put five layers of clear coat over them. Here are closer pics of them from the post I had last year. <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20000503-1-000335.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20000503-1-000335.html</A>  The rear speaker boxes are gone though. I went back to the stock look. The sound wasn't worth the alteration and I put Pioneer 4X6's in that local <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
